   $q$Which word or phrase best fills the blank at the start of sentence 8?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Instead of","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"false-contrast"},{"text":"Despite","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reversed-logic"},{"text":"Thanks to","is_correct":true},{"text":"Similar to","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-relationship"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Thanks to$q$, $q$Families reached safety because of Brennan's warnings, so "Thanks to" shows that cause. "Despite" would mean the families escaped even though she sent warnings, which reverses the relationship.$q$, 'draft', 'ca6d2cdb-7b02-594e-b9ce-ffad53a7f469')
