   $q$Which phrase best fills the blank at the start of sentence 8?$q$, $q$[{"text":"For the two schools that did not switch","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-passage"},{"text":"However","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"false-contrast"},{"text":"Because of the monitor's comment","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-cause-effect"},{"text":"In addition","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$In addition$q$, $q$Sentence 8 adds another benefit at the switched schools, so "In addition" fits. The monitor's comment did not cause fewer stomachaches, so that phrase confuses a report with a cause.$q$, 'draft', '2c3ba757-29e3-50d1-9750-e68f0936d7e4')
