values
  ('61087fb0-1583-5e3b-9873-379e257f9f35', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g10-writing-with-evidence'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Which revision of sentence 11 would best conclude the draft?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Mehta's team weighed the leftover food on students' trays every Friday for an entire school year.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"evidence-without-analysis"},{"text":"Mehta's study suggests that moving recess before lunch helps students eat more of their meals, a small schedule change with real benefits.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Recess is also important because students need time to make friends and play outdoor games.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-topic-detail"},{"text":"Recess before lunch would make every student in the country healthy and successful in school.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralization"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Mehta's study suggests that moving recess before lunch helps students eat more of their meals, a small schedule change with real benefits.$q$, $q$The best conclusion restates the claim and reflects the study's main finding about eating. The choice about every student becoming healthy and successful claims much more than one four-school study shows.$q$, 'draft', '2c3ba757-29e3-50d1-9750-e68f0936d7e4')
