   $q$Which sentence should the writer remove because it does not help explain why the project worked?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Sentence 6, because details about repairs are less important than the amount of rain.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"},{"text":"Sentence 2, because it describes the town before the project began.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"},{"text":"Sentence 8, because a quotation repeats what sentence 7 already says.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"},{"text":"Sentence 9, because the number of articles Haddad has written is not evidence about Sela Verde.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Sentence 9, because the number of articles Haddad has written is not evidence about Sela Verde.$q$, $q$Sentence 9 is about the author's career, not the project. Sentence 2 is needed because it shows the problem the tanks solved, which makes the results meaningful.$q$, 'draft', '3c35cde6-c7ef-58c9-a379-4f3795d988df')
